    {
      "type": "text", "id": "now_txt", "x": 56, "y": 150, "width": 670, "height": 100,
      "text": "Case drill-down (LIVE): Case list = one METADATA row per case\n(QN . facility . result . status . visit . enumerator . login)\n'Responses ->' opens CSWeb View case - full answers, but ONE case\nat a time, in a modal, no table view, no export.\nDashboard sits behind the shared /docs basic-auth (user aspsi).",
      "originalText": "Case drill-down (LIVE): Case list = one METADATA row per case\n(QN . facility . result . status . visit . enumerator . login)\n'Responses ->' opens CSWeb View case - full answers, but ONE case\nat a time, in a modal, no table view, no export.\nDashboard sits behind the shared /docs basic-auth (user aspsi).",
