      "text": "Case list - 26 in view   [ Export CSV (26) ]\n----------------------------------------\ncsv: inst,qn,region,province,city,facility,\n     ownership,service_level,patient_type,\n     sex,result,status,visit,enumerator,\n     login,supervisor,replacement,gps,mode\n1 row per case IN THE CURRENT VIEW\n(filters + search applied) - built client-side",
