    {
      "type": "text", "id": "colB_mock_txt", "x": 572, "y": 380, "width": 436, "height": 162,
      "text": "/docs/data/  (SEPARATE login, not the dashboard's)\nResponses data room - regenerated every 2 min\n f1_responses.csv        1 row/case . ~315 cols\n f3_responses.csv        1 row/case . ~330 cols\n f3_roster_q94_lab.csv   1 row/QN x occurrence\n   ... 10 F3 roster files\n f4_responses.csv        1 row/case . ~230 cols\n f4_roster_household.csv  23 items x 20 occ\n   ... 10 F4 roster files\n f2_responses.csv        1 row/response . 18 cols\n+ per-instrument PREVIEW table (sticky header,\n  scrollable) so you can eyeball before download",
      "originalText": "/docs/data/  (SEPARATE login, not the dashboard's)\nResponses data room - regenerated every 2 min\n f1_responses.csv        1 row/case . ~315 cols\n f3_responses.csv        1 row/case . ~330 cols\n f3_roster_q94_lab.csv   1 row/QN x occurrence\n   ... 10 F3 roster files\n f4_responses.csv        1 row/case . ~230 cols\n f4_roster_household.csv  23 items x 20 occ\n   ... 10 F4 roster files\n f2_responses.csv        1 row/response . 18 cols\n+ per-instrument PREVIEW table (sticky header,\n  scrollable) so you can eyeball before download",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
